.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4710 If power is lost, the control will delay this amount of time after power is restored before restarting the unit.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4715 Enable/disable the activation of the [Shutdown - Loss Of Power] event. If set to 'disabled', the event will not be annunciated. This implies that the event will not be placed in any active event list or in any event history list.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4716 The event type for the [Shutdown - Loss Of Power] event.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4718 Enable/disable the activation of the [Customer Input 1] event.  If set to 'disabled', the event will not be annunciated.  This implies that the event will not be placed in any active event list or in any event history list.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4719 The event type for the [Customer Input 1] event.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4721 Enable/disable the activation of the [Smoke Detected] event. If set to 'disabled', the event will not be annunciated. This implies that the event will not be placed in any active event list or in any event history list.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4722 The event type for the [Smoke Detected] event.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4724 Enable/disable the activation of the [Water Under Floor] event. If set to 'disabled', the event will not be annunciated. This implies that the event will not be placed in any active event list or in any event history list.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4725 The event type for the [Water Under Floor] event.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4727 Enable/disable the activation of the [Service Required] event. If set to 'disabled', the event will not be annunciated. This implies that the event will not be placed in any active event list or in any event history list.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4728 The event type for the [Service Required] event.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4868 Calculated month of the next scheduled maintenance. Used in conjunction with [Calculated Next Maintenance Year].
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4869 Calculated year of the next scheduled maintenance. Used in conjunction with [Calculated Next Maintenance Month].
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.4870 The ratio of operations performed to the calculated operations available between maintenance intervals.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5002 Air temperature measured at the outlet of the unit.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5004 Dew point temperature measured at the inlet of the unit.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5005 Minimum value of remote sensor temperature measurements.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5006 Maximum value of remote sensor temperature measurements.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5007 Average value of remote sensor temperature measurements.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5008 Desired air temperature.  This set point is dependent upon which sensor is selected for control.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5009 Temperature control band above [Air Temperature Set Point]. If measured air temperature is within this band, cooling operations are proportionally controlled.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5010 Temperature control band below [Air Temperature Set Point]. If measured air temperature is within this band, heating operations are proportionally controlled.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5011 Value that is divided evenly to form a temperature range above and below [Air Temperature Set Point]. If measured air temperature is within this range, no heating or cooling will occur.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5012 Sensor from which air temperature measurements will be used for cooling and heating control.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5013 Calculation method applied to temperature readings from the remote sensors to determine a single temperature measurement value for cooling and heating control.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5014 Threshold value used in the [Supply Air Over Temperature] event.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5018 Threshold value used in the [Supply Air Under Temperature] event.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5022 Threshold value used in the [Return Air Over Temperature] event.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5027 Relative humidity at the outlet of the unit.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5028 Relative humidity measured at the inlet of the unit.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5029 Desired relative humidity.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5030 Humidity control band below [Humidity Set Point]. If measured humidity is within this band, humidification operations are proportionally controlled.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5031 Humidity control band above [Humidity Set Point]. If measured humidity is within this band, dehumidification operations are proportionally controlled.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5032 Value that is divided evenly to form a range above and below [Humidity Set Point]. If measured humidity is within this range, no humidification or dehumidification will occur.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5033 Threshold value used in the [High Return Humidity] event.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5035 Threshold value used in the [Low Return Humidity] event.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5047 Fan control mode.   Allowable modes are: (0) Auto - Fan speed is controlled via the selected fan control sensor, and, (1) Manual - Fan will operate at a fixed speed.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5048 Temperature control band above the temperature set point calculated for proportional fan speed control. If measured air temperature is within this band, fan speed operations are proportionally controlled.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5049 Manual fan speed.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5050 Maximum fan speed.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5051 Minimum fan speed.
.1.3.6.1.4.1.476.1.42.3.9.30.1.70.1.2.1.5052 Sensor from which air temperature measurements will be used for fan speed control.
